   "summary": "Turns a verb into the noun for doing it: mendoj (to think) → mendim (thought).",
   "note": "-im is also the 'we' ending on verbs: flasim = we speak, ishim = we were. A word in -im is only a noun if a verb in -oj/-ej sits behind it.",
